    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d237">

                <pb facs="0396" n="280" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg280"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/1663.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Sullivan.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-01-28T19:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 28, 1915—7 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Answering your January 27. You are instructed to support the President in
                    enforcing his orders for removal of governor of Puerto Plata and for resistance
                    to Vidal’s activities. Navy Department has been asked to send ship <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Castine</hi> to Puerto Plata.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
